<title>USA: MBIA approves four corporate deals for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA approves four corporate deals for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it approved for secondary market insurance the following four corporate bond issuers:</p>
<p>--Iowa Illinois Gas and Electric first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>--Midwest Power first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>--Mid American Energy debentures.</p>
<p>--US West Communications Inc debentures.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
</text>
